  "types": [
    {
      "name": "ApprovedAsset",
      "docs": [
        "One curator-approved asset, binding its mint to its official Pyth",
        "PriceUpdateV2 feed. Its address is a PDA seeded by the registry and the mint,",
        "so existence of this account is the approval check: add_asset derives the",
        "address and fails if no account is there. Created only by the registry",
        "authority; add_asset copies `price_feed` from here so the manager never",
        "supplies the feed."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "registry",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "price_feed",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "AssetConfig",
      "docs": [
        "One basket asset. Its address is a PDA seeded by the strategy and the asset's",
        "index, so the full set is the contiguous range 0..asset_count: any handler",
        "computing net asset value re-derives every index and refuses to proceed if an",
        "asset account is missing."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "strategy",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "index",
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "price_feed",
            "docs": [
              "Pyth PriceUpdateV2 account, copied from the registry's ApprovedAsset at",
              "add time so the manager cannot substitute a feed they control."
            ],
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "vault",
            "docs": ["Strategy-owned associated token account holding this asset."],
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "weight_bps",
            "docs": [
              "Target share of the strategy's value in basis points. deposit deploys at these",
              "weights (the sum across assets must reach 10000 before deposits open), and the",
              "manager maintains them against price drift with rebalance."
            ],
            "type": "u16"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "AssetRate",
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "usdc_per_token",
            "docs": [
              "USDC base units per token base unit.",
              "e.g. 250 means 1 token base unit = 250 USDC base units",
              "(so 1.0 TSLAx = $250 when both have 6 decimals)"
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Registry",
      "docs": [
        "The curator record at the root of an approved-asset set. This account holds no",
        "list: it only names the authority allowed to approve assets under it. The set",
        "itself is the collection of `ApprovedAsset` accounts derived from this registry,",
        "and an asset counts as approved exactly when its `ApprovedAsset` account exists.",
        "",
        "The authority is deliberately not a strategy manager: the curator vets which",
        "real assets (and which official price feed) are safe, and a manager only",
        "chooses among them. This is what stops a manager from listing a token they",
        "mint themselves, or pairing a real mint with a feed they control."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "authority",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Strategy",
      "docs": [
        "One strategy (basket). Its address is a PDA seeded by a caller-chosen index,",
        "e.g. seeds `\"strategy\" + 0`, so strategies are addressed by a simple counter",
        "rather than by the manager's key. The index is stored here so every handler",
        "can re-derive the PDA to sign for the vaults and share mint."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "index",
            "docs": ["Index used as the PDA seed, e.g. 0 for the first strategy."],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "manager",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "registry",
            "docs": [
              "Registry whose curator approves assets. add_asset only accepts mints",
              "approved in this registry."
            ],
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "share_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "usdc_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "swap_router",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "fee_bps",
            "docs": ["Annual management fee in basis points (e.g. 100 = 1%)."],
            "type": "u16"
          },
          {
            "name": "max_slippage_bps",
            "docs": [
              "Maximum tolerated deviation, in basis points, between a swap's output and",
              "the Pyth-implied amount on deposit/rebalance. Bounded by MAX_SLIPPAGE_BPS."
            ],
            "type": "u16"
          },
          {
            "name": "total_shares",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "last_fee_accrual_timestamp",
            "type": "i64"
          },
          {
            "name": "asset_count",
            "docs": [
              "Assets live at PDAs indexed 0..asset_count, so callers can re-derive the",
              "complete set and no asset can be silently omitted from a NAV calculation."
            ],
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "total_weight_bps",
            "docs": ["Running sum of every asset's target weight, kept <= 10000."],
            "type": "u16"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
